# Dependencies / builds — never ship these into the build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/build

# Git, CI, editor
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Environment & secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests / docs / misc not needed at image build time
**/test
**/tests
**/docs
**/*.log
**/README.md
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*
**/openapi.json
**/.openapi-cache
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.sentryclirc
